# Outfit body (R18): light armour, an angular chest plate over the torso, steel pauldrons, accent spine stripe and
# a glowing status light. Torso frame as outfit_vest (pivot 4 5 0 on spine_03).
name outfit_armour
grid 5
size 9 10 11
slot plate SwatchMain
slot steel Steel
slot stripe SwatchAccent
slot light SwatchGlow
shell 0 0 1 8 10 10 1 plate
carve box 1 1 1 7 9 9
carve box 2 3 9 6 7 10
poly 3 9 plate 7,1 8,0 9,2 9,8 8,10 7,9
box 1 0 9 7 3 11 steel
box 1 7 9 7 10 11 steel
box 0 0 1 8 10 2 steel
paint box 8 4 3 9 6 9 stripe
box 8 1 7 9 2 8 light
pivot 4 5 0
